{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nengchi, can you hold yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A prodigious cultivator from the Sect of Pure Retreat, Nengchi has long transcended worldly temptations. On the cusp of immortality yet stuck at his final bottleneck, he's forced to undertake a dangerous trial in &quot;Eden of Yao&quot;, a pleasure den teeming with seductive Yao.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through first-person perspective, you'll encounter a Immortal who takes delight in teasing you, a attractive girl who\u2019s only innocent on the outside, a bodyguard with personalities of contrast, a lethal assassin who\u2019s also alluring, and the Yao Queen who has karmic entanglement with you from past lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As these temptresses unleash their charms, can you hold your Chan mind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Character Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rules you better obey when in the Eden of Yao -</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ye Xiaoying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Follow me... I'll tell you a secret.&quot; - Remember don\u2019t pry into her true identity, it\u2019s dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/IMG_9194.gif?t=1750824653\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Shushu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Let's just say... you look at it several times daily~&quot; - She\u2019s harmless in daily life, but never let her get to you. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/IMG_9201.gif?t=1750824653\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lili</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;So... you wanna get punished?&quot; - It\u2019s okay to help her, but never mess with the things in her room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/IMG_9197.gif?t=1750824653\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Venerable Immortal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Nengchi... are you sure your body can take this?&quot; - Your reliable guide, who wears multiple masks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/IMG_9195.gif?t=1750824653\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Yufen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Mister, just play along with me.&quot; - Be on guard against her attacks, especially her kisses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who among them will eventually become an Immortal couple with you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/IMG_9199.gif?t=1750824653\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u221aImmersive first-person perspective experience:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live-action + POV interactions, make every seduction in \u201cEden of Yao\u201d alarmingly tangible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u221aMulti-brunches storyline:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large number of options and over a hundred branches. Some of these branches are interwoven and can be switched at any time. A slip of thought may ruin your path to Immortal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u221aRich gameplay mechanics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Album of Yao: Document each beauty's true form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freezing Spell: [Evil Grin]~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive gameplay: The bump of Cultivation Method... oh, yeah!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dreamland: How to choose among five?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709650?t=1750824653","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709650?t=1750824653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/e8fadbaf2062b349888091d368cd2fc40b0f6159/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750824653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/e8fadbaf2062b349888091d368cd2fc40b0f6159/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750824653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nengchi, can you hold yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A prodigious cultivator from the Sect of Pure Retreat, Nengchi has long transcended worldly temptations. On the cusp of immortality yet stuck at his final bottleneck, he's forced to undertake a dangerous trial in &quot;Eden of Yao&quot;, a pleasure den teeming with seductive Yao.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through first-person perspective, you'll encounter a Immortal who takes delight in teasing you, a attractive girl who\u2019s only innocent on the outside, a bodyguard with personalities of contrast, a lethal assassin who\u2019s also alluring, and the Yao Queen who has karmic entanglement with you from past lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As these temptresses unleash their charms, can you hold your Chan mind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Character Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rules you better obey when in the Eden of Yao -</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ye Xiaoying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Follow me... I'll tell you a secret.&quot; - Remember don\u2019t pry into her true identity, it\u2019s dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com