21aMulti-brunches storyline:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large number of options and over a hundred branches. Some of these branches are interwoven and can be switched at any time. A slip of thought may ruin your path to Immortal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u221aRich gameplay mechanics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Album of Yao: Document each beauty's true form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freezing Spell: [Evil Grin]~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive gameplay: The bump of Cultivation Method... oh, yeah!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dreamland: How to choose among five?</p>","developers":["Mountain and Sea Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/3df37a1e5119a7805b87e5efd5de4477bfdcd254/header.jpg?t=1750824653","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156293,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156293/movie480.mp4?t=1749811920","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156293/movie_max.mp4?t=1749811920"},"name":"\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247\u82f1\u8bed","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156293/ab4e7a63ddb5669ef1a9117bf12c34aa2ce53fcb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749811920","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156293/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749811920","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156293/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749811920"}}],"name":"The Love's Ordeal","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Inter Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> \u72ec\u7acb\u663e\u5361\u6216\u96c6\u621